Error [E0120]: `name` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/return_borrowed_param.jet:1:33
    |
  1 | fn pick(name: String) String -> name
    |                                 ^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return ~name;` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `name: ^String`. There's no borrow-return in v1 — to share the value without a full copy, store an owned field, or reach for `Shared<T>`/`Id<T>` once a real program needs shared ownership
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
